# Upstream (Uwe Ohse) is dormant: the last formal release is 0.12.20 (1998) and
# the packaged 0.12.21rc has effectively been the final release for over twenty
# years. ohse.de does not index the 0.12.21rc tarball on any browsable page,
# but Uwe's GitHub repository README links it directly, so scan that page for
# the release and fetch the tarball from its canonical location on ohse.de.
opts="downloadurlmangle=s%^http://%https://%" \
https://github.com/UweOhse/lrzsz \
(?:.*/)?lrzsz-(\d[\d.]+\w*)\.tar\.gz
